# DDR SELECTION — DDR A3 files the feature reads (paths relative to the
# install's data/ dir; no Konami bytes live in this repo).
#
# Consumed by import_a3_assets.sh / import_a3_assets.bat, which copy files
# from an A3 install into <World>/data_mods/ddr_selection_a3/<path>:
#   always   copied on every run — World's copy is known bad
#            (dance_combo0005_v0.arc decompresses to all zeros).
#   missing  copied only when the World install has no copy (a stock World
#            install ships all of them, byte-identical or a superset).
# The `_sel` background movies are not listed: DirectShow opens movies
# directly, so a data_mods copy would never be seen.

